==English==

===Etymology===
''[[sneaker]]'' (''implying being [[carry|carried]]'') + ''[[net]]'', from ''[[Internet]]''

===Noun===
{{en-noun|-}}

# {{context|computing|informal|humorous}} A method of [[transfer]]ring a [[computer program]] from one computer to another by copying it to a [[floppy disk]] or some other external storage, carrying the disk to the other computer and [[install]]ing it there, in contrast with [[electronic]] methods used by [[networked]] computers to transfer data.

